  "details": "I like to use the mobile app to check who’s online when I’m not at my desktop PC. Currently, there doesn’t seem to be any way to group or filter (aka. search) in your friends list on the native app when under the “Online Friends” tab. Additionally, the order of the friends on that list seems to be arbitrary, as they don’t seem to be sorted alphabetically, by groups, nor by status. Overall, the friends list feels confusing to use on the mobile app as it currently stands.\n\nMy feedback/feature request is to make the friends list on mobile behave and match the same features as on the web app: show friends by groups, and the ability to filter (“search”) friends by name.\n\nI’m on iOS, but I don’t know if the Android version behaves the same or not, as I currently don’t own an Android phone.",
